# =============================================================================
# APRO CAD — .gitignore
#
# This repo tracks SOURCE, not build output or training data. A full working
# tree is ~35 GB (mostly target/ + model checkpoints), so anything regenerable
# is excluded here deliberately.
#
# Convention: an entry starting with "/" is anchored to the repo root. That
# distinction matters below — the self-contained `needle-training/` bundle is
# tracked, while root-level copies of the same generated data are not.
# =============================================================================

# ---------- Rust build output ----------
# ~34 GB. Regenerate with `cargo build`.
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# ---------- Packaged Windows build ----------
# ~17 MB of exe, not source. Rebuild with `cargo build --release`.
/dist/

# ---------- Cargo / Rust tooling ----------
# Cargo.lock IS tracked on purpose: this repo ships binaries, so the lockfile
# is what makes builds reproducible.

# ---------- Node / frontend ----------
node_modules/
.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo

# NOTE: src/vendor/ (three.js + addons) is intentionally TRACKED. The frontend
# is bundler-free and loads them from an importmap, so they are runtime source.

# ---------- Python ----------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ---------- Needle model training artifacts ----------
# Model weights and downloaded checkpoints: large binaries, regenerable.
# `/my_needle.cact` is a built .cact model (tens of MB) — never commit it.
/checkpoints/
/my_needle.cact
*.cact
*.safetensors
*.pt
*.pth

# Tool caches for the training pipeline.
.cache/

# Root-level copies of generated training data and the fine-tune logs.
# Root-anchored ("/") so the curated, self-contained needle-training/ bundle
# keeps its own committed copies in needle-training/data/.
/generated_data.jsonl
/needle_train_v2.jsonl
/narrow_generated.jsonl
/narrow_train.jsonl
/seed_narrow.jsonl
/train.log
/train.err
/ft.log
/ft.err
/ft2.log
/ft2.err
/ftn.log
/ftn.err
/ng.log
/ng.err
/run_ft.py
/run_ftn.py
/gen_seed_narrow.py

# A nested duplicate working copy of the training bundle (its own venv,
# checkpoints and caches — ~734 MB). Not source; it is a copy of the tracked
# needle-training/ tree and must never be committed.
needle-training/needle-training-new/

# ---------- Logs ----------
*.log
*.err
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ---------- Secrets / local config ----------
# The app stores API keys in localStorage at runtime, never in the repo.
# Keep it that way: no credentials, tokens or .env files belong here.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.secret
secrets.json

# ---------- OS noise ----------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---------- Editor / IDE ----------
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ---------- Scratch files from local verification ----------
*.tmp
*.bak
